The {{ill|Five Elements theory|de|Fünf-Elemente-Lehre|ja|五行思想|1=Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)|2=ja|3=五行思想|lt=Five Elements (Wuxing)|lt=Five Elements|lt_ja=五行|lt_de|Fünf Elemente|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Five Elements theory|13=User:Immanuelle/Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)|qq=}} is also applied here, assigning the following to each of the {{ill|Twelve Earthly Branches|1=Earthly Branches|lt=Twelve Earthly Branches|de|Zwölf Erdzweige|ja|十二支|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Twelve Earthly Branches|13=User:Immanuelle/Earthly Branches|qq=}}|

